      "anchor": "[AFTER-CL:REQ-001]",
      "body": "The plotter shall accept and display the 2D solution set for any single implicit quadratic equation in x and y of the form `Ax^2 + Bxy + Cy^2 + Dx + Ey + F = 0`, with at least one of A, B, or C non-zero, including mathematically equivalent rearrangements. A graph contains no more than one equation. *(S1; pinned Story request as narrowed by recorded clarification, specification generation 2)*",
